{"unit_id":"QQQW114__dsh-effort-slider#card-zh","repo":"QQQW114/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"da9a42814ff31695b7fc76683a94443e97a3e034","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-slider 是面向 DSH Web 的界面插件：它替换模型选择区域中的推理等级菜单，并以紧凑的阻尼滑块呈现可选档位。插件保留模型与推理等级两层菜单，使用 DSH 的 modelDirectories 服务读取模型目录并提交选择。用户可以浏览并切换模型、拖动滑块选择推理等级，也可以用方向键逐档调整；滑块根据档位数量适配位置，最高档显示动态彩色效果。适合希望在 Web 客户端更直观地调整推理等级的 DSH 用户。运行时使用 DSH 客户端和 React 提供的接口，无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:126-178","lib/client.js:232-290","lib/client.js:446-467"]}
{"unit_id":"QQQW114__dsh-effort-slider#card-en","repo":"QQQW114/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"da9a42814ff31695b7fc76683a94443e97a3e034","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-effort-slider replaces the DSH Web effort menu with a damped slider. Users can switch models, drag to choose reasoning levels, or use arrow keys to move between levels. It uses DSH modelDirectories and React, with no extra key or service setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:126-178","lib/client.js:232-290","lib/client.js:446-467"]}
